<Layout title="Privacy — NOVEXA DIGITAL" description="NOVEXA DIGITAL privacy notice for website visitors and project enquiries."><PageHero eyebrow="Privacy" title="Privacy notice" intro="A plain-language draft explaining how website enquiry information is handled." /><section class="section white"><article class="narrow legal"><p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 29 August 2026</p><p>This notice is a general website privacy draft and may be updated as NOVEXA DIGITAL’s systems and legal requirements develop.</p><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>When you submit an enquiry, we may collect your name, email address, organisation, budget range, project information and any other details you choose to provide. Basic technical data may also be processed by our hosting provider for security and operation.</p><h2>How we use it</h2><p>We use enquiry information to respond, assess project fit, prepare requested proposals and maintain appropriate business records. We do not ask for sensitive health, payment or authentication information through this website.</p><h2>Service providers</h2><p>Website hosting and form processing may be provided by Netlify or a replacement provider. Their systems may process data in other jurisdictions subject to their terms and safeguards.</p><h2>Retention and disclosure</h2><p>We retain information only as long as reasonably needed for enquiries, engagements, legal obligations and legitimate business records. We do not sell personal information. Information may be shared with professional advisers, service providers or authorities where reasonably necessary or required by law.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may request access to, correction of or deletion of personal information we hold, subject to legal exceptions. Contact <a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@novexa.digital">hello@novexa.digital</a>.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>Other websites have their own privacy practices. NOVEXA is not responsible for those practices.</p></article></section></Layout>
